Warhol, and other famous artists.
Just like buying shares in Tesla,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:50.640
you’d buy shares in these artworks&nbsp;
that have been securitized by the SEC.

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:53.680
I was really excited about working&nbsp;
with Masterworks as I’m a huge fan

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:57.760
of art and try to collect what I can. 
I absolutely fell in love with Monet’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:57.760 --> 00:08:02.160
paintings in particular when I lived in&nbsp;
Paris and would roam around all the museums,

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:06.880
soaking in his famous Water Lillies works. 
When Masterworks sells the art, you get your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:11.280
portion of the proceeds - which worked&nbsp;
out to a 32% net return for those who

