invested in Banksy's Mona Lisa and 31.7% for
investors in George Condo’s Staring into Space.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:22.160
What’s great about investing in art is that it
protects you from the bull market we’re in.

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:25.680
Plus, the art market shows&nbsp;
no signs of slowing down.

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:29.200
Contemporary art has outpaced&nbsp;
the S&amp;P in the last decade.

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:32.400
So it was no surprise that the Wall&nbsp;
Street Journal said “art is among

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:37.360
the hottest markets on earth right now”
